repository-code: "https://github.com/<your-github-user>/kathareel"
url: "https://github.com/<your-github-user>/kathareel"
abstract: >-
  A Claude Code / Codex skill that turns any topic into a narrated motion-graphics
  explainer video with a Hinglish (Hindi-in-Latin-script) voiceover and an
  English-only board: English titles, chapter cards, HUD, progress bar and subtitles.
  Black canvas with a star-field or dot-field backdrop, white line art with purple
  accents, word-aligned subtitles and a chapter progress bar; every frame is drawn in
  code with Remotion (React + TypeScript). Ships a compilable template, primitives and
  lighting library, voiceover / storyboard / render / QC tooling, written style and
  motion specs, a multi-agent build protocol and a complete reference film as the
  quality bar. Derived from the open-source anything2explainer project by Vincent Wei.
keywords:
  - claude-code
  - codex
  - agent-skill
  - remotion
